    "turn_text": "All right, buddy. Thank you so much. Have a fantastic weekend. Thanks for the call. Do appreciate it. And two, three, three, nine, eight. That's the number that you can get on. Well, we'll have our knock it off rants. I like that. That's a good one. But he brings us such valid points too. I mean, whatever happens to critical thinking. And in today's world, it doesn't need to be really all that critical. I mean, it could just be like ultra basic thinking. You don't even have to hurt your brain at all. Because like I said, the Democrats today, they're not hiding it. They're not trying to candy coat anything and go, oh, no, we're not doing that. Yes, we are. No, we're not doing that. I mean, it's not even like that anymore. I mean, they will, they will tell you they're not doing something as they're doing it right in front of your face. And they do it with a smile, you know, like that, that little kid that is trying to get away with something and looks at you when they're doing it, you know, if you're a parent, you've had kids that do that. And they're like, no, don't, no, and they're touching it, no, don't. And then next thing, no, there it goes. 233-9988, that is the number for the show. Good morning. Welcome to the Brian Rush Show.",
