oing to dump hundreds of millions of dollars into. It is only for them to go out and spread the marketing message of protecting the climate. It's not like they're gonna go out and help pick up trash in a park, go off and spend some time working to clean a brook or a creek or anything or help doing some stuff to actually clean the environment and get it better, no. Instead, it's a marketing racket. Hundreds of millions of dollars are going to be going into this marketing racket for people to go out in the civilian climate core. Of course, remember, that's one of the pet projects of AOC. 233-9988 is the number. Good morning. Welcome to the Brian Rush Show. Oh, sorry. I missed you. And it's just, it's a mess. The wasted money that we're actually seeing with that. 233-9988 is the number for the show. Good morning. Welcome to the Brian Rush Show.",
