raziness that is going on. And it's just, it's crazy. We've got to do something about it and we have to make some phone calls. We've got to call the senators. We've got to call the congressmen. We've got to let them know that, hey, not cool, can't be doing this. It has got to change. And one of those people that we're going to talk with coming up here in just a couple minutes is going to be congressmen done. got him in the queue, so he'll be he'll be on in in just a couple minutes. So get ready for that conversation. We'll keep on as long as we possibly can. I know that he's busy, but we'll we'll try. So if you're living with some awful joint pain, don't let them tell you surgeries. You're on the option QC kinetics. They are here and our listeners are loving the amazing non-surgical result for joint pain. QC kinetics is the leader in biologic therapies, regenerative solutions that can repair and restore damage tissue in your joints. And they do it with no drugs, no surgery, no downtime. So if you've got that knee pain, back pain, shoulder pain, or pain in the hips, patients are raving about the great lasting results that they are getting from QC kinetics, give them a call, find out more about them 850-270-39-850-270-39. Hang on, coming up, we're going to be chatting with Congressman Neal Dunn next.",
